+// candidate 2 has simply removed the protection."
+//
+// Concurrency protection lives entirely in idx_swi_dedup, via the ON CONFLICT
+// clause — never in the anti-churn brake — so neither recurrenceExpected nor the
+// deferral may weaken it. Two operators submitting the same domain at once must
